SELECT t.id, cr.id, 3, E'★★ *I will pour out of my Spirit upon all flesh* (Acts 2:17) — at Shavuot the *pour my spirit upon thy seed* (Isaiah 44:3) is declared fulfilled, *this is that which was spoken by the prophet Joel*.'
